@startuml j5-no-key-run
!include style.iuml
title J5 No AI key, or the AI step fails
actor Patient
participant "Chat page /" as Chat
participant "POST /api/chat" as Api
participant "answer.ts" as Ans
participant "ai.ts" as Ai
participant "matcher.ts\n(matchClinicFile)" as M
autonumber

Patient -> Chat : "What are your Saturday hours?"
Chat -> Api : POST {chatId, message}
Api -> Ans : answerPatient(message, clinic)
Ans -> Ans : guards and booking check first, as always
alt no AI key is set (hasAiCredentials is false), or useAi is false
  Ans -> M : matchClinicFile(message, clinic)
else a key is set
  Ans -> Ai : askModel: one attempt, stopped at 8 seconds
  alt the call fails or is late, the JSON is wrong, or code rejects the answer
    Ans -> M : matchClinicFile(message, clinic)
  else the answer passes every check
    Ai --> Ans : the answer, source ai, no label
  end
end
M --> Ans : the fact from the clinic file, label "Answered from the clinic file"
note right of M
Not in the file: "not sure", a call back within
2 working hours and a needs human ticket (P3);
no price from a neighbouring service.
end note
Ans --> Api : reply, source clinic-file, label
Api --> Chat : {reply, source, label}
Chat --> Patient : the reply with the label under it
note over Api : if answerPatient itself throws, the route answers again with the AI step off
@enduml
